{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Sonara 可把 iPhone 變成即時分貝計、噪音劑量計與頻率分析器，適合工作場所噪音檢查、音樂會、教室、家居錄音及保護聽力等情境使用。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，量測過程無廣告且無需帳戶。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-125.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>即時分貝與噪音劑量</h2>\n<p>Sonara 提供即時 dB 讀數、波形、平均值與峰值，支援 A、B、C、Z 頻率加權、Slow、Fast、Impulse 反應時間、校準偏移及響亮噪音提示。噪音劑量計可追蹤每日劑量、TWA、LAeq 與 Lmax，參照 NIOSH 及 OSHA 上限；頻譜分析具 1/3 八度 RTA 頻段與主頻率，並可自動儲存量測記錄及匯出 PDF 報告。Sonara 並非認證儀器，讀數僅供參考。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-150-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-151-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-152-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-153-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-154-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-155-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Sonara: Decibel &amp; Noise Meter</li><li>應用類別：Utilities</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/sonara-decibel-noise-meter/id6823983074?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.554462+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":374,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T18:35:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:42.961756+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:42.961756+00:00","content_hash":"b51c59abc1a935cb955e25bb5974a13066942c5c80219cea6196ca634a11357b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}